    slug: "abednego",
    headword: "Abednego",
    category: "person",
    body: "Servant of Nego=Nebo, the Chaldee name given to Azariah, one of Daniel\u2019s three companions (Dan. 2:49). With Shadrach and Meshach, he was delivered from the burning fiery furnace (3:12-30).",
    seeAlso: []
