    body: "Father of the sea; i.e., \u201Cseaman\u201D the name always used in Kings of the king of Judah, the son of Rehoboam, elsewhere called Abijah (1 Kings 15:1, 7, 8). (See ABIJAH.)",
    seeAlso: []
