    body: "(Acts 27:27; R.V., \u201Cthe sea of Adria\u201D), the Adriatic Sea, including in Paul\u2019s time the whole of the Mediterranean lying between Crete and Sicily. It is the modern Gulf of Venice, the Mare Superum_ of the Romans, as distinguished from the Mare Inferum_ or Tyrrhenian Sea.",
