    body: "Brother of help; i.e., \u201Chelpful.\u201D (1.) The chief of the tribe of Dan at the time of the Exodus (Num. 1:12; 2:25; 10:25). (2.) The chief of the Benjamite slingers that repaired to David at Ziklag (1 Chr. 12:3).",
    seeAlso: []
