    headword: "Amasiah",
    category: "person",
    body: "Burden of (i.e., \u201Csustained by\u201D) Jehovah, the \u201Cson of Zichri, who willingly offered himself unto the Lord,\u201D a captain over thousands under Jehoshaphat (2 Chr. 17:16; comp. Judg. 5:9).",
    seeAlso: []
