    category: "place",
    body: "A name given to Abi-albon, or, as elsewhere called, Abiel, one of David\u2019s warriors (2 Sam. 23:31; 1 Chr. 11:32), probably as being an inhabitant of Arabah (Josh. 15:61), a town in the wilderness of Judah.",
    seeAlso: []
