    slug: "bildad",
    headword: "Bildad",
    category: "person",
    body: "Son of contention, one of Job\u2019s friends. He is called \u201Cthe Shuhite,\u201D probably as belonging to Shuah, a district in Arabia, in which Shuah, the sixth son of Abraham by Keturah, settled (Gen. 25:2). He took part in each of the three controversies into which Job\u2019s friends entered with him (Job 8:1; 18:1; 25:1), and delivered three speeches, very severe and stern in their tone, although less violent than those of Zophar, but more so than those of Eliphaz.",
