    body: "(1.) The bed of the sea or of a river (Ps. 18:15; Isa. 8:7). (2.) The \u201Cchanelbone\u201D (Job 31:22 marg.), properly \u201Ctube\u201D or \u201Cshaft,\u201D an old term for the collar-bone.",
    seeAlso: []
