    body: "Smoking furnace, one of the places where \u201CDavid himself and his men were wont to haunt\u201D (1 Sam. 30:30, 31). It is probably identical with Ashan (Josh. 15:42; 19:7), a Simeonite city in the Negeb, i.e., the south, belonging to Judah. The word ought, according to another reading, to be \u201CBor-ashan.\u201D",
    seeAlso: []
