    body: "Spoken of warriors (Ex. 15:4; Judg. 20:16), of the Hebrew nation (Ps. 105:43; Deut. 7:7), of Jerusalem as the seat of the temple (1 Kings 11:13). Christ is the \u201Cchosen\u201D of God (Isa. 42:1); and the apostles are \u201Cchosen\u201D for their work (Acts 10:41). It is said with regard to those who do not profit by their opportunities that \u201Cmany are called, but few are chosen\u201D (Matt. 20:16). (See ELECTION.)",
