    category: "thing",
    body: "Treasure. (1.) One of the sons of Seir, the native princes, \u201Cdukes,\u201D of Mount Hor (Gen. 36:21, 27). (2.) 1 Chr. 7:21; (3.) 4:4. (4.) One of the Gadite champions who repaired to David at Ziklag (12:9). (5.) A Levite (Neh. 3:19). (6.) A priest (12:42).",
    seeAlso: []
