    body: "(1.) Heb. \u2018attik (Ezek. 41:15, 16), a terrace; a projection; ledge. (2.) Heb. rahit (Cant. 1:17), translated \u201Crafters,\u201D marg. \u201Cgalleries;\u201D probably panel-work or fretted ceiling.",
