    body: "The whole of practical piety (1 Tim. 4:8; 2 Pet. 1:6). \u201CIt supposes knowledge, veneration, affection, dependence, submission, gratitude, and obedience.\u201D In 1 Tim. 3:16 it denotes the substance of revealed religion.",
    seeAlso: []
