    category: "thing",
    body: "Wrapped up, a place on the north border of Palestine. The \u201Cway of Hethlon\u201D (Ezek. 47:15; 48:1) is probably the pass at the end of Lebanon from the Mediterranean to the great plain of Hamath (q.v.), or the \u201Centrance of Hamath.\u201D",
