    body: "Suspicion of a wife\u2019s purity, one of the strongest passions (Num. 5:14; Prov. 6:34; Cant. 8:6); also an intense interest for another\u2019s honour or prosperity (Ps. 79:5; 1 Cor. 10:22; Zech. 1:14).",
