    slug: "jeruel",
    headword: "Jeruel",
    category: "place",
    body: "Founded by God, a \u201Cdesert\u201D on the ascent from the valley of the Dead Sea towards Jerusalem. It lay beyond the wilderness of Tekoa, in the direction of Engedi (2 Chr. 20:16, 20). It corresponds with the tract of country now called el-Hasasah.",
