    body: "Surplus; excellence. (1.) Father-in-law of Moses (Ex. 4:18 marg.), called elsewhere Jethro (q.v.). (2.) The oldest of Gideon\u2019s seventy sons (Judg. 8:20). (3.) The father of Amasa, David\u2019s general (1 Kings 2:5, 32); called Ithra (2 Sam. 17:25). (4.) 1 Chr. 7:38. (5.) 1 Chr. 2:32; one of Judah\u2019s posterity. (6.) 1 Chr. 4:17.",
