    body: "=Jehon\u2019adab. (1.) The son of Rechab, and founder of the Rechabites (q.v.), 2 Kings 10:15; Jer. 35:6, 10. (2.) The son of Shimeah, David\u2019s brother (2 Sam. 13:3). He was \u201Ca very subtil man.\u201D",
