    headword: "Lo-ammi",
    category: "thing",
    body: "Not my people, a symbolical name given by God\u2019s command to Hosea\u2019s second son in token of Jehovah\u2019s rejection of his people (Hos. 1:9, 10), his treatment of them as a foreign people. This Hebrew word is rendered by \u201Cnot my people\u201D in ver. 10; 2:23.",
