    category: "thing",
    body: "A shed for a watchman in a garden (Isa. 1:8). The Hebrew name melunah is rendered \u201Ccottage\u201D (q.v.) in Isa. 24:20. It also denotes a hammock or hanging-bed.",
    seeAlso: []
