    body: "(2 Kings 23:13; Vulg., \u201Cmount of offence\u201D), the name given to a part of the Mount of Olives, so called because idol temples were there erected in the time of Solomon, temples to the Zidonian Ashtoreth and to the \u201Cabominations\u201D of Moab and Ammon.",
    seeAlso: []
