    body: "The heifer, a town in Benjamin (Josh. 18:23), supposed to be identical with the ruins called Far\u2019ah, about 6 miles north-east of Jerusalem, in the Wady Far\u2019ah, which is a branch of the Wady Kelt.",
    seeAlso: []
