    category: "thing",
    body: "Breach, the elder of the twin sons of Judah (Gen. 38:29). From him the royal line of David sprang (Ruth 4:18-22). \u201CThe chief of all the captains of the host\u201D was of the children of Perez (1 Chr. 27:3; Matt. 1:3).",
