    body: "Babylonian, the current, broad-flowing, one of the \u201Cfour heads\u201D into which the river which watered the garden of Eden was divided (Gen. 2:11). Some identify it with the modern Phasis, others with the Halys, others the Jorak or Acampis, others the Jaab, the Indus, the Ganges, etc.",
    seeAlso: []
