    slug: "rest",
    headword: "Rest",
    category: "thing",
    body: "(1.) Gr. katapausis, equivalent to the Hebrew word noah (Heb. 4:1). (2.) Gr. anapausis, \u201Crest from weariness\u201D (Matt. 11:28). (3.) Gr. anesis, \u201Crelaxation\u201D (2 Thess. 1:7). (4.) Gr. sabbatismos, a Sabbath rest, a rest from all work (Heb. 4:9; R.V., \u201Csabbath\u201D), a rest like that of God when he had finished the work of creation.",
    seeAlso: []
