    body: "Watchman. (1.) A Simeonite (1 Chr. 4:37). (2.) The father of one of the \u201Cvaliant men\u201D of David\u2019s armies (1 Chr. 11:45). (3.) Assisted at the purification of the temple in the time of Hezekiah (2 Chr. 29:13).",
    seeAlso: []
