    body: "=Zared, luxuriance; willow bush, a brook or valley communicating with the Dead Sea near its southern extremity (Num. 21:12; Deut. 2:14). It is called the \u201Cbrook of the willows\u201D (Isa. 15:7) and the \u201Criver of the wilderness\u201D (Amos 6:14). It has been identified with the Wady el-Aksy.",
